{"id":"vod_sn_35986","vodId":"35986","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士555","name_cn":"假面骑士555","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f2fa925076f00aebf370fec8d97b34ab.jpg"},"summary":"“流星塾”出身的“园田真理”，收到了来自父亲“花形”寄来的不明物品：“Faiz Gear和其专属机车”。为了问明父亲的用意，真理前往位于东京的巨大企业“SmartBrain”拜访父亲。途中遇上到处旅行的“干巧”，因真理放Faiz Gear的旅行袋和干巧被偷走的旅行袋一样而产生误会。正在争执的时候，两人被突然出现的不明怪物袭击．．．。　　“把Faiz腰带交出来！”　　另一边，“木场勇治”是一位家境富裕，父母慈祥和蔼，有交往将满一年女友的幸福青年。一场车祸夺走勇治双亲的性命也令勇治陷入昏睡。两年后，在勇治心跳停止，医生宣告死亡的当晚，“木场勇治”再次醒了过来．．．。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/USmTEBeuhc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/FvBzD2UbPk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8cRyHuRb3H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/a7nWgVSy3H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ShGG0Hh8EA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qkWi6p0bPk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uTGBzBqzib1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/pyPSM764ym1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UkC4pADWwk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GxSkqGujPX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Z188ZGg3XT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/W9eugjKnFa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UCr5hcWaB81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/LfJ0sCNk8t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15